| 7a | WAVE TWO | `C15` the joined face's workbench seat | A joined browser keeps its page writes local: a non-Kahu face founds its own workbench of `lares`, and on 2026-11-14 the steward's own seated fleet join read the floor and kept a new tiddler in its own daemon working layer; the browser leg of every dogfood day writes nowhere the house reads until the fleet join carries the face's share entries and seat. |

